      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BEACHBABE CROCKER (10) broke last start but still managed to salute by 4 metres over 1660m at this track. That was a pleasing progression after missing the placings the run before. May just need a bit of luck at some point from this difficult draw. Won't find this any harder and she can win again. OURBEACHGIRLMAYWYN (6) finished sixth two runs ago then broke and finished a distant last over 2138m at this track at the latest appearance. Meets a similar line up so she is sure to be a force if the manners improve. MAGIC JUJON (7) is a great chance after a string of sound recent performances, the latest a solid fifth at Redcliffe over 2040m. Hard to find fault. FLORAS FOLLY (2) is worth some thought based on her third over 1660m at this track two runs ago.",
